<section id="faq" class="faq-section">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    
    <header class="faq-header">
      <h2 class="faq-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="faq-subtitle">
        Everything you need to know about your ZenDesk Pro before buying it
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="faq-accordion">
      
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">How to install the ZenDesk Pro?</span>
          <span class="question-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            It's extremely simple. Just unfold it over your bed 
            or desk and adjust the support angles to your preference. 
            It requires no additional tools or complicated instructions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">Is it compatible with my laptop?</span>
          <span class="question-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Of course! The ZenDesk Pro's universal design makes it compatible 
            with the vast majority of laptops up to 17 inches, including MacBook, 
            Dell, HP, Lenovo, and all major brands.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">How long does shipping take?</span>
          <span class="question-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            We handle ultra-fast shipping. Once your order is confirmed, 
            we process and ship it in less than 24 business hours. You'll receive 
            a tracking code via email so you can track your package 
            at all times.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">Do you have a satisfaction guarantee?</span>
          <span class="question-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Absolutely. If you don't love your ZenDesk Pro, you have 30 days 
            to return it no questions asked. Your satisfaction is our number one 
            priority and we're 100% sure you're going to love it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">What weight does the desk support?</span>
          <span class="question-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            The ZenDesk Pro is designed with high-quality materials and can 
            support up to 15kg of weight safely and stably. Perfect 
            for large laptops, books, tablets, and accessories without any issues.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 6 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">Can it be used for reading or breakfast?</span>
          <span class="question-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Yes! The ZenDesk Pro is multifunctional. You can use it to work 
            with your laptop, read books, have breakfast in bed, watch shows on the 
            tablet, or even draw. Its versatile design adapts to all your 
            needs.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 7 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">Is the material resistant and durable?</span>
          <span class="question-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Totally. It is manufactured with premium bamboo wood (or high-density 
            MDF depending on the model) with anti-scratch and moisture-resistant 
            finishes. Designed to last for years with daily intensive use.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>

    <!-- Extra Support -->
    <div class="faq-support">
      <p class="support-text">
        Do you have another question? 
        <a href="mailto:support@zeniahome.com" class="support-link">Contact us here</a>
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* ============================================
     FAQ SECTION - ACCORDION DESIGN
     ============================================ */
  
  .faq-section {
    background: var(--color-bg-primary);
    padding: var(--space-3xl) 0;
  }

  .faq-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .faq-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .faq-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ============================================
     FAQ ACCORDION - NATIVE <DETAILS>
     ============================================ */
  
  .faq-accordion {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ============================================
     FAQ ITEM - INTERACTIVE CARD
     ============================================ */
  
  .faq-item {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
  }

  .faq-item:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium);
  }

  .faq-item[open] {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium);
  }

  /* ============================================
     FAQ QUESTION - SUMMARY STYLING
     ============================================ */
  
  .faq-question {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
    list-style: none;
    transition: background var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .faq-question::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .faq-question:hover {
    background: #F9FAFB;
  }

  .faq-item[open] .faq-question {
    background: #F3F4F6;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #E5E7EB;
  }

  .question-text {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    padding-right: var(--space-md);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* ============================================
     QUESTION ICON - ANIMATED CHEVRON
     ============================================ */
  
  .question-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--color-accent-warm);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
  }

  .faq-item[open] .question-icon {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
    background: var(--color-cta-green);
  }

  /* ============================================
     FAQ ANSWER - EXPANDABLE CONTENT
     ============================================ */
  
  .faq-answer {
    padding: 0 var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg);
    animation: fadeIn var(--transition-smooth) ease-in;
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-10px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .faq-answer p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ============================================
     SUPPORT SECTION
     ============================================ */
  
  .faq-support {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FEF3C7 0%, #FDE68A 100%);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .support-text {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .support-link {
    color: var(--color-cta-green);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    text-decoration: underline;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .support-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-cta-green-hover);
  }

  /* ============================================
     MOBILE RESPONSIVE
     ============================================ */
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .faq-section {
      padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    }

    .faq-question {
      padding: var(--space-md);
    }

    .faq-answer {
      padding: 0 var(--space-md) var(--space-md);
    }

    .question-text {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .question-icon {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
    }

    .question-icon svg {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
    }

    .faq-support {
      padding: var(--space-md);
    }

    .support-text {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "faq-acordeon"
}
{% endschema %}
